    "title": "Joni Mitchell Announces 'Joni's Jazz' Box Set - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Joni Mitchell Announces ‘Joni’s Jazz’ Box Set\nBy Allison Rapp,\n13 hours agoJoni Mitchell has announced a forthcoming box set highlighting her lifelong love of jazz music, titled Joni's Jazz. The 61-track collection, available in both CD and vinyl format, draws from just about Mitchell's entire catalog, starting with her debut album Song to a Seagull. It contains studio recordings, live performances and rare alternate takes, including two previously unreleased 1980 demos. One of them, \"Be Cool,\" can be heard below.",
